# Normalise line endings for every text file.
#
# `.agent/index.json` records a sha256 of every analyzed file, so the committed
# context is only reproducible if every checkout of this repository is
# byte-identical. A CRLF checkout (the default for git on Windows) produced
# different hashes than an LF one (Linux, CI), which made the self-scan gate
# fail on a clean clone no matter how the context was regenerated.
#
# This pins text to LF in the working tree on every platform, so the analyzer
# sees the same bytes everywhere. Blobs are already LF; this changes no content.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary